{"4383880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Huntin' Buddies", "steam_appid": 4383880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE JOB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective: Hunt animals and meet quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice: Forest wildlife may act unpredictably. Proceed with caution, some creatures may be hostile.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT YOU DO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You're a contract hunter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Accept contract from pager <br>- Hunt specific animals as per contract<br>- Carry kills to truck<br>- Get paid </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The animals are wrong.<br>Deer with eyes on same side of head. Rabbits that scream. Goats that speak Latin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383880/extras/2f4d1a63fbffd18ba2a2448bd31153a3.poster.avif?t=1785241760\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383880/extras/2f4d1a63fbffd18ba2a2448bd31153a3.webm?t=1785241760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383880/extras/2f4d1a63fbffd18ba2a2448bd31153a3.mp4?t=1785241760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carcass explodes when overstretched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 PLAYER COOP || voice chat || Shared contract progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNTING - One-shot kills || Limited ammo </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CONTRACTS - 15 unique nights - Escalating difficulty - Specific animal requirements - Weight quotas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRANSPORT - Drag your kills together. Stretch them too far, and they'll explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOCATIONS - Pine Valley , Granger Farms, Blackmire Swamp</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works solo. Better with friends, up to 4 players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everyone spawns at camp. Everyone extracts together or dies trying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hunt. Extract. Repeat. <i>Don't think about what the animals are saying.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383880/extras/bf92c422f6b859abf66d4b17f8bf9d65.poster.avif?t=1785241760\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383880/extras/bf92c422f6b859abf66d4b17f8bf9d65.webm?t=1785241760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383880/extras/bf92c422f6b859abf66d4b17f8bf9d65.mp4?t=1785241760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE JOB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective: Hunt animals and meet quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice: Forest wildlife may act unpredictably. Proceed with caution, some creatures may be hostile.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT YOU DO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You're a contract hunter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Accept contract from pager <br>- Hunt specific animals as per contract<br>- Carry kills to truck<br>- Get paid </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The animals are wrong.<br>Deer with eyes on same side of head. Rabbits that scream. Goats that speak Latin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383880/extras/2f4d1a63fbffd18ba2a2448bd31153a3.poster.avif?t=1785241760\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383880/extras/2f4d1a63fbffd18ba2a2448bd31153a3.webm?t=1785241760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383880/extras/2f4d1a63fbffd18ba2a2448bd31153a3.mp4?t=1785241760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carcass explodes when overstretched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 PLAYER COOP || voice chat || Shared contract progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNTING - One-shot kills || Limited ammo </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CONTRACTS - 15 unique nights - Escalating difficulty - Specific animal requirements - Weight quotas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRANSPORT - Drag your kills together. Stretch them too far, and they'll explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOCATIONS - Pine Valley , Granger Farms, Blackmire Swamp</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works solo. Better with friends, up to 4 players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everyone spawns at camp. Everyone extracts together or dies trying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hunt. Extract. Repeat. <i>Don't think about what the animals are saying.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383880/extras/bf92c422f6b859abf66d4b17f8bf9d65.poster.avif?t=1785241760\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383880/extras/bf92c422f6b859abf66d4b17f8bf9d65.webm?t=1785241760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\">